	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. P. D.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Inveni de improviso apud nos (vir doctissime) domini <persName ref="p1974">Martini</persName> refutationem<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1"><persName ref="p1974">Luthers</persName> Schrift "Contra 32 articulos Lovaniensium theologistarum"; s. <ref target="file12374">Nr. 2327</ref>, Anm. 8.</note> <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>articulorum nostro dogmati plane contrariorum, quos <placeName ref="l1322">Lovanienses</placeName> nuper impie <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>satis aedere ausi fuerunt<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">Zu den 32 Artikeln der <placeName ref="l1322">Löwener</placeName> Theologen s. <bibl source="b18">HBBW XV</bibl> 303, Anm. 6. - <persName ref="p1974">Luther</persName> kannte wahrscheinlich den <placeName ref="l267">Kölner</placeName> Nachdruck; s. <bibl source="b671">WA</bibl> LIV 4121. 416-422.</note>.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Volui ergo tibi describere ac mittere, quia uni<lb xml:id="p1z4"/>cum tantum apud nos inveniebatur exemplar.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Sed quia chalcographus noster<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3">Damit könnte entweder <persName ref="p4676">Christian Egenolff d.Ä.</persName> oder <persName ref="p5499">Andreas Kolbe</persName> gemeint sein; s. <bibl source="b535">Reske</bibl> 603f. Sollte <persName ref="p4676">Egenolff</persName> zutreffen, könnte dieser den Neudruck von <persName ref="p1974">Luthers</persName> Schrift bei <persName ref="p5105">Hermann Gülfferich</persName> in <placeName ref="l157">Frankfurt a. M.</placeName> <bibl source="https://gateway-bayern.de/VD16+L+4256">(VD16 L4256)</bibl> veranlasst haben.</note> <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>impressurum se promittebat, distuli in praesens, ac iam tibi apud praesentem <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>nuntium<note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4">Unbekannt.</note>, nostrum conterraneum, mitto,<note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5">Damit ist entweder der <placeName ref="l157">Frankfurter</placeName> Druck von <persName ref="p1974">Luthers</persName> Schrift (s. Anm. 3) oder eine Abschrift <persName ref="p8469">Hindermanns</persName> gemeint.</note> maxime hac ex<pb type="edition" next="144"/> causa, quia te <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>priores <placeName ref="l1322">Lovaniensium</placeName> articulos habere scivi,<note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6">Siehe nämlich <bibl source="b18">HBBW XV</bibl> 303-305,1-15. 313f,30-38. 341f.</note> utpote qui mihi, domi cum <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>essem, eos describendos dederis,<note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7">Zur Abschrift siehe <bibl source="b18">HBBW XV</bibl> 317f und Anm. 5.</note> tum etiam quia plane persuasum habebam <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>hanc articulorum <foreign xml:lang="el">ἀντιλογίαν</foreign><note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8">Widerlegung [der <placeName ref="l1322">Löwener</placeName> Artikel].</note> ad vos non pervenisse, quia iam demum aedita<note xml:id="fn9" type="footnote" n="9"><persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName> hatte die Schrift jedoch schon von <persName ref="p8354">Georg Frölich</persName> erhalten; s. <ref target="file12374">Nr. 2327</ref> bei Anm. 8.</note>.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z10"/>Tu (ut soles) pro tua humanitate hos articulos domini <persName ref="p1974">Martini</persName>, si prius <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>habes, a me candide suspicias ac aequi bonique consulas; sufficere <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>enim me voluisse haec ad te mittere puto.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div2" corresp="regest2">
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Novi praeterea nihil est, <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>nisi quod dicitur <persName ref="p18538">caesarem</persName><note xml:id="fn10" type="footnote" n="10"><persName ref="p18538">Karl V.</persName></note> maximum conscribere exercitum contra evangelicos.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z14"/>Id verum sit nec ne, non pronuntio.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Deinde m. <persName ref="p1456">Wigandus</persName><note xml:id="fn11" type="footnote" n="11"><persName ref="p1456">Wigand Happel</persName>.</note> nuptias sple<lb xml:id="p1z15"/>ndidissimas celebravit 18. ianuarii cum domini <persName ref="p18103">Ferrarii</persName><note xml:id="fn12" type="footnote" n="12"><persName ref="p18103">Johann Eisermann</persName>.</note> <persName ref="p5141">filia</persName><note xml:id="fn13" type="footnote" ana="bio" n="13"><persName ref="p5141">Katharina, geb. Eisermann</persName>.</note>,<note xml:id="fn14" type="footnote" n="14">Zu der Hochzeit s. <ref target="file12394">Nr. 2347</ref>,34-43.</note> quibus nos<note xml:id="fn15" type="footnote" n="15">Die damals in <placeName ref="l311">Marburg</placeName> studierenden <placeName ref="l587">Zürcher</placeName>; s. <ref target="file12394">Nr. 2347</ref>, Anm. 1.</note> etiam <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>interesse dignatus est.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Dii boni, quantum vidisses apparatum per 3 dies, <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>quantam virorum doctorum coronam!</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Tertium est, quod te scire volo: <persName ref="p3590">Princeps</persName><note xml:id="fn16" type="footnote" n="16">Landgraf <persName ref="p3590">Philipp von Hessen</persName>.</note> <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>13. ianuarii misit <persName ref="p21056">filiam</persName> suam<note xml:id="fn17" type="footnote" n="17"><persName ref="p21056">Anna von Hessen</persName>, die am 28. Februar <persName ref="p21174">Christine von Pfalz-Zweibrücken</persName> gebar.</note> <persName ref="p19247">matre</persName><note xml:id="fn18" type="footnote" n="18">Christine von Sachsen, Landgräfin von <placeName ref="l213">Hessen</placeName>.</note> comitante et <persName ref="p7645">gynaecio</persName><note xml:id="fn19" type="footnote" n="19"><persName ref="p7645">Elschen von Löwenstein</persName>; vgl. <bibl source="b474">PA</bibl> I 17, Nr. 22.</note> ali<lb xml:id="p1z19"/>quotque comitibus et nobilibus genero suo, duci <persName ref="p18935">Wolfgango Bipontano</persName><note xml:id="fn20" type="footnote" n="20">Graf <persName ref="p18935">Wolfgang von Pfalz-Zweibrücken</persName>.</note>.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z20"/>6.<note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a"><hi>In der Vorlage 6 aus</hi> 16 <hi>korrigiert.</hi></note> februarii mater reversa <placeName ref="l311">Marpurgum</placeName> ibique per aliquot dies mansit.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z21"/>Deinde princeps ipse 26. ianuarii <placeName ref="l311">Marpurgum</placeName> venit petiturus <placeName ref="l157">Fran<lb xml:id="p1z22"/>cfordiam</placeName>, ubi comitia<note xml:id="fn21" type="footnote" n="21">Zum Schmalkaldischen Bundestag in <placeName ref="l157">Frankfurt</placeName> s. <ref target="file12366">Nr. 2319</ref>, Anm. 50. Zu <persName ref="p3590">Philipps</persName> Reise nach <placeName ref="l157">Frankfurt</placeName> a. M. s. <ref target="file12382">Nr. 2335</ref> bei Anm. 21.</note>.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">9. februarii reversus ad nos <placeName ref="l311">Marpurgum</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Ibi per ali<lb xml:id="p1z23"/>quot dies mansit cum tota aula sua causasque, quae circa <placeName ref="l3381">Lani</placeName> tractum<note xml:id="fn22" type="footnote" n="22">Das Land an der <placeName ref="l3381">Lahn</placeName>. - Es war seit dem 13. Jahrhundert ein Kondominium der Grafschaft <placeName ref="l3577">Nassau-Weilburg</placeName> und der Landgrafschaft <placeName ref="l213">Hessen</placeName>; s. Alexander <hi>Jendorff</hi> Condominium. Typen, Funktionsweisen und Entwicklungspotentiale von Herrschaftsgemeinschaften in Alteuropa anhand hessischer und thüringischer Beispiele, <placeName ref="l311">Marburg</placeName> 2010 - Veröffentlichungen der Historischen Kommission für <placeName ref="l213">Hessen</placeName> 72, S. 129f und bes. 148f; s. ferner <bibl source="b474">PA</bibl> II 645f, Nr. 2029; 855, <ref target="file12391">Nr. 2344</ref>.</note> <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>diu suspensae fuerunt, exaudivit, item studiosorum quorundam, qui a civibus <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>maximis affecti iniuriis, vulnerati et lacerati miris modis.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z26"/>Id etiam te scire volo, quod dominus <persName ref="p3138">Theobaldus</persName><note xml:id="fn23" type="footnote" n="23"><persName ref="p3138">Theobald Thamer</persName>.</note> iam Apocalypsin orsus est, bre<lb xml:id="p1z27"/>viter perstringens omnia finiturus 3 aut 4 septimanis.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div3" corresp="regest3">
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Novi praeterea <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>apud nos nihil est, nisi quod idem apud nos (proh dolor!) omnium rerum <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>penuria et caritas maxima.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Mittuntur ab acadaemia quotidie litterę <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>supplices<note xml:id="fn24" type="footnote" n="24">Nicht ermittelt.</note> ad principem pro frumento, qui aliquo modo, quantum<pb type="edition" next="145"/> potest, iuvat.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z31"/><placeName ref="l558">Wittenbergae</placeName> et <placeName ref="l284">Lypsiae</placeName> omnia minori comparantur pretio.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Multi apud <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>nos 30 fl. pro mensa numerare tenentur; quod tamen nos (deo laus!) <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>facere nondum cogimur.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Sed miraris forsan, quod tanta in frument<lb xml:id="p1z34"/>i regione caritas maxima sit; ipsi miramur, aliique omnes.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Nuntius <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>autem praesens poterit tibi rem omnem narrare.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Is vidit, quantus nuper <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>ad curiam pro frumento concursus fuerit.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la">Haec tibi (pater clementissim<lb xml:id="p1z37"/>e) volui significare, ut statum nostrum omnium scires.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la">Tu, ut hactenus <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>semper ecclesiae inprimis et nostrum commodum spectasti, id porro <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>facere non cesses.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la">Nos, quod aequum et iustum est, faciemus.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div4" corresp="regest4">
				<p>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Boni <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>meas literas incultas consule ac omnes moecenates nostro nomine <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>plurimum salutes.</s>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale.</s>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutato nomine omnium totam tuam familiam, dom<lb xml:id="p1z42"/>inum <persName ref="p8171">Theodorum</persName><note xml:id="fn25" type="footnote" n="25"><persName ref="p8171">Theodor Bibliander</persName>.</note>, cognatum meum observandissimum,<note xml:id="fn26" type="footnote" n="26">Über eine Verwandtschaft zwischen <persName ref="p8171">Bibliander</persName> und <persName ref="p8469">Hindermann</persName> ist nichts bekannt; s. schon <bibl source="b17">HBBW XIV</bibl> 682 mit Anm. 14.</note> aliosque, d. <persName ref="p8127">Pellicanum</persName>, etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z43"/><persName ref="p8469">Heinrycus Opisander</persName> <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinus</placeName>, tui observantissimus.</s>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z44"/><placeName ref="l311">Marpurgi</placeName>, 1546, 10. februarii.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf der Rückseite:]</note>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Doctissimo ac fidelissimo <lb xml:id="p2z2"/><placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> ecclesiae ministro <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>domino m. <persName ref="p495">Heinryco <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>Bullingero</persName>, moecenati <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>suo observandissimo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="32" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z6"/><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
